            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "哇，大家真的玩得很开心？太好了！超开心！/n真的，开演前我一直怕得要命！就在想“这样真的行吗”！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414120320",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 209,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
                    "SpineId": 40321,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141412036,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141412,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 33,
            "SpeakerName": "评论",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "“行！超行！”“已经不是奖励的程度了！”“票价也太便宜！”/n“配信镜头也猛爆了！”“Very Nice！”“反而让我觉得对不起！”",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414120330",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141412037,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141412,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 34,
            "SpeakerName": "评论",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "“沉浸式剧场的经验真的活用了”/n“《爱丽丝》的时候也做过吧，大家一起给女王Call！这就是进化版！”",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414120340",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141412038,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141412,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 35,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "就是这个！沉浸式剧场的时候，把观众卷进来超有意思。/n大家的反应也特别好～。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414120350",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
                    "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 8,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 40321,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141412039,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141412,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 36,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "对对，《爱丽丝》的时候也有和观众席一起嗨起来的经验。/n算成功经验？之类的？所以我就在想，能不能把这个玩得更彻底！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414120360",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141412040,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141412,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 37,
            "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "我一直一直在想帕克。然后就想到一件事。/n把我认为“最像帕克”的所有点子，全都彻底做一遍！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414120370",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "403"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141412041,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141412,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 38,
            "SpeakerName": "评论",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "“完全对味！”“So Good！！”“真的很有电姬版帕克的感觉！”/n“全场都超开心！”“配信留言的势头也超猛！”",
            "VoiceFileName": "1414120380",
